  "title": "Marshmallow Fondant",
  "description": "Marshmallow fondant made with mini marshmallows. This sweet, tasty, and fun rolled fondant is much easier to make than a traditional boiled fondant.",
  "authors": [
    "Kiele Briscoe"
  ],
  "date_published": "2009-02-18T16:40:07-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-03-16T07:13:28-04:00",
