  "keywords": [
    "publisher-tested"
  ],
  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "1 (16 ounce) package miniature marshmallows",
    "0.25 cup water",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 pounds confectioners' sugar, divided"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jxKNozaE0uoF_j3jnQpABifPbWQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/191275-marshmallow-fondant-step-1-BG-8642-81fb9c862fe84f158727056d51fc12c1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/191275/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place butter in a shallow bowl and set aside until needed for kneading.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place marshmallows in a large microwave-safe bowl and microwave on high to start melting the marshmallows, 30 seconds to 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4QlmcvPs_IBnSalwzAdJST3EuNQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/191275-marshmallow-fondant-step-2-BG-8644-7b784baa7c754304baec50d5a77a12b3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/191275/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully stir water and vanilla into hot marshmallows; stir until the mixture is smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hsfsbmsh5d81bjP5xrE5ABL5jTQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/191275-marshmallow-fondant-step-3-BG-8646-2e8f92eece5a46acab255358a7996c31.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/191275/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly beat in confectioners' sugar, 1 cup at a time, until you have a sticky dough. Reserve 1 cup confectioners' sugar for kneading. The dough will be very stiff.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sIL3ucA72vUZmrgdB0Y8rbAIfvs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/191275-marshmallow-fondant-step-4-BG-8658-6afb5e203b194cdc809db27edbcce4b6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/191275/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rub your hands thoroughly with butter and begin kneading the sticky dough. As you knead, the dough will become workable and pliable. Turn the dough out onto a working surface dusted with confectioners' sugar and continue kneading until the fondant is smooth and no longer sticky to the touch, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oFkwWy2S2c7iVdQETzzraUnAA6Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/191275-marshmallow-fondant-step-5-BG-8670-05453b48ead1471a90d629438a7dc972.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/191275/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Form the fondant into a ball, wrap it tightly in plastic wrap, and refrigerate, 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MgVpBhJ7vbAOWBw8pL8i8IeXwoI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/191275-marshmallow-fondant-step-7alt-BG-8682-fec3dc238e1d469abc322fcc53946617.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/191275/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To use, allow the fondant to come to room temperature and roll it out onto a flat surface dusted with confectioners' sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KOwaEWB9FuOJrq9VgB2z_mRqfEI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/191275-marshmallow-fondant-beauty-4x3-BG-8694-9568acef64f44bc69a243a374bc5f634.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/191275/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
